WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:06.940
The end of a long week at work. Tomek has lost track of the days.

2
00:00:07.790 --> 00:00:09.470
Jaki dzisiaj jest dzień?

3
00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:11.720
Dzisiaj jest piątek.

4
00:00:12.370 --> 00:00:14.770
Super! Jutro jest sobota.

5
00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:18.360
Today, and then tomorrow.

6
00:00:19.010 --> 00:00:21.210
W sobotę mam wolne. A ty?

7
00:00:21.860 --> 00:00:24.660
Ja też. Do zobaczenia w poniedziałek!

8
00:00:26.410 --> 00:00:28.410
W sobotę mam wolne.

9
00:00:29.210 --> 00:00:34.050
To say on a day, put one short word in front of it.

10
00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:39.280
A day that ends in the letter a also changes its ending.

11
00:00:39.630 --> 00:00:43.790
The names of the days are written with a small letter.

12
00:00:45.990 --> 00:00:48.470
Ask what day it is today.

13
00:00:51.970 --> 00:00:53.650
Jaki dzisiaj jest dzień?

14
00:00:54.450 --> 00:00:58.010
Did you say it? Say it once more, out loud.

15
00:00:59.810 --> 00:01:01.490
Jaki dzisiaj jest dzień?

16
00:01:03.490 --> 00:01:06.930
Today is Monday. Say it.

17
00:01:10.430 --> 00:01:12.510
Dzisiaj jest poniedziałek.

18
00:01:13.310 --> 00:01:16.870
Did you say it? Say it once more, out loud.

19
00:01:18.670 --> 00:01:20.750
Dzisiaj jest poniedziałek.

20
00:01:22.750 --> 00:01:25.550
Say goodbye until tomorrow.

21
00:01:29.050 --> 00:01:30.050
Do jutra!

22
00:01:30.850 --> 00:01:34.410
Did you say it? Say it once more, out loud.

23
00:01:36.210 --> 00:01:37.210
Do jutra!

24
00:01:39.210 --> 00:01:42.770
Now practise with the exercises below the video.
